Template: recoll-semantic/ollama-host
Type: string
Default:
Description: Ollama server URL (leave empty for local):
 If you use a remote GPU server for embeddings, enter its URL here
 (e.g. http://gpu-server:11434). Leave empty to use a local ollama
 instance.

Template: recoll-semantic/pull-model
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Download the embedding model now?
 The nomic-embed-text model (~274 MB) is required for semantic search.
 If you use a remote ollama server that already has the model, you can
 skip this step. The download may take several minutes.
